What is the result of the following program?<br>
<pre><code>    program side-effect (input, output);
    var x, result: integer;
    function f (var x:integer:integer;
    begin
        x:x+1;f:=x;
    end
    begin
    x:=5;
    result:=f(x)*f(x);
    writeln(result);
    end</pre></code>
